#: scenario8:scenario8_81A09D56_1B8C_4CD2_905C_DB402E7A3EA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c3f3085e03921dd70644efba2fc4ad26e1408dc29ff732b8a83a90f6f31e14a
#. default-sha256: 25b24191615aaa09b6c783063b734f75ec8d9ecc51e7f1932b1d2f03f99036ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_81A09D56_1B8C_4CD2_905C_DB402E7A3EA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Because I didn’t think telling him,⟪k:3⟫“I know the future, and I need your help "
"to change it,”⟪k:4⟫would have gone over very well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫在那种情况下，⟪k:3⟫就算说自己是从未来穿越回来帮你的，⟪k:4⟫他也不会认同的吧，⟪k:5⟫而"
"且——"

#: scenario8:scenario8_76D86C95_45E6_48FA_8872_08145E46314B
