msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91c1cd34196b7ff44145702f610297ebd9373cecebbff231068f2646abb462f8
#. default-sha256: f7836b3ef4146284e018a4f3e53d9c4e19aaee87f35d31d0188f4dab466e4e41
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30BA81B2_E88F_4371_B721_F454315186DB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(I was always the one with nothing to offer,⟪k:2⟫powerless to be of anyone’s help...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（……我是曾失去过一切的人。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫　从来，没能成为谁的依靠……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 261c96974ecd3b6b01703340fbcee27499cad761fadf1efb8f8e04702ae42736
#. default-sha256: f3cfa8348ccfba740812b226f432971329f5b19e1fdd9fb4b014242a003d8570
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E5CF6BA9_138D_49E3_9CB8_FC80B4880C15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(So if anything’s motivating me,⟪k:1⟫it’s not concern for the boy,)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫（所以我所怀抱着的，⟪k:1⟫一定不是「无法坐视不理」这种温柔的⟪k:2⟫　感情——⟪k:3⟫只是想要证明，即"
"使是我……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccfdb5a1f8286854de3ac09bc2e18c76010c3c5b96d6f082767150b6530c7fe1
#. default-sha256: f829a4e2ba2470a5bff7683727a5f35ef1be4b25fe701bffb420ceae2e0ec2ec
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BD7747DE_86D3_46FC_AFE1_6BF62A19A690"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t take much arm-twisting to get him to give us a room, so who knows, maybe "
"he’ll come over to our side easier than either of us expect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不过，⟪k:3⟫梅尔不是准备了房间了嘛。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫说不定，他马上就能成为我们的帮手哦？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5908a3ffe738b5cb6e22dabc90d47b4c2a3f6074468882d712db7ebe49e26d47
#. default-sha256: 4db37a0f597b4d942d8fb86df5914fc780b8a1dccfb8302f36b6e2173b399dc7
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5E712CB4_EEA8_4836_804D_C91839E58BA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He doesn’t trust me, but he also doesn’t know enough about me to decide what to do "
"yet. ⟪k:3⟫He needs time, and doing this gives him that time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫只是，⟪k:3⟫目前他还在试图摸清我是什么来头，怀揣什么目的。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫所以打算花些时间"
"看透我的身份，而暂时观望罢了。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2950e9c30d4a7cf407a7c3f2d724b1d250e81e9247b5e3a9246900bdea1692d4
#. default-sha256: 7d35848f29ebbbef7e5bebebd2876e0cc3ace186cddf1d3f7e95ad86813a7ff2
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_773302FC_AD94_4149_BACB_EAB20C88C142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he decides keeping me around is not to his advantage, he will act accordingly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫如果他做出「我的存在是种妨碍」的判断——⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫即使是他这种性格的人，也会出手的。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6426aff9586810ceebb3b93687bca9a5e8f42693884dd027a7897bfc098897d6
#. default-sha256: 5f11eb7046f339bd9230c785780fd6d47562d2bdd0bdc17b4a0951ebc0d1cf4c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7EB3B130_8F81_43CA_9175_9451787DAAF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I don’t think he has the spine for it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我不认为他有如此胆量。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20181e233f0702d0390923d9801d6a08af6f0db517f2adbf1d1a4d4fe3e6e2a6
#. default-sha256: 81ce5e9c83db19d27de5fcad4403c2abb1db85ba1daada748507bae8bbcb9aae
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_83225998_CFAD_4684_8752_ADB0FCF8A1FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you ever have a chance... ⟪k:3⟫to see the shadows trapped in the mansion?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫你……⟪k:3⟫没在那座馆里与三个男人的影子相遇过吗？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5532b8bce9de725016d621f307e2a4b9b7df316d6418936792b95e0b2bd83916
#. default-sha256: f75353a2fc5d66a097c132bfb73026e0766bee4d115238a1f05453c2917cba5f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_AB0BAADD_89E6_44F7_93C5_40473ED2B1D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I... ⟪k:3⟫I might have.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫But around the time Hayden Rhodes passed away..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫也许——见过吧。⟪k:3⟫不过，⟪k:4⟫我……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫在海登・罗兹死后……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54dee36089d66b9c339b154380cebecaed8d202192ada85ea969365ebcf6cbe7
#. default-sha256: df99c2d6c0cae5b687060627205341be93ac234ac87810b17131b3062327d45a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6591ABB7_3ECF_42DA_A772_10B347A8F0F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had become... ⟪k:3⟫merely another part of the cursed mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……那个时候……⟪k:3⟫我自身，⟪k:4⟫也只是被诅咒的馆——⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫构造的一部分而已。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8db16c5f71726984615202a294e712e147d53950813fbda6d860450a40346113
#. default-sha256: b96e6d243b7e925dd6d558ee517bd0ffc1e35f16395c3f855c813f9820e8add4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6E4778C7_DDCC_40D3_862B_C4C0A1EA6828"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I suppose, much like the rules differ between the realms of the living and the dead, ⟪k:1⟫"
"so too do they differ for those who have lost their grip on reality.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（就如同死生两界般……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫　也许正常和疯狂间，也有着界线吧……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcfb7963bb865dd2739211c8072fb48c31af1dcd506381bf29bc2a7271be6721
#. default-sha256: 0e61706a7ddd966aa357b43ab363826ac5fb9115e1af97556db44bdddf65e506
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_95792F4E_5D61_4604_82D7_950532DD00CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Someone else is holding the reins.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My first guess would be the lord, but "
"regardless..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫主犯是别人……或者应该说是领主吧……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫无论如何……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbc551b831dc39d3b7b6c6da95d9ece5ad37bb1be12312b32099e6d012afa094
#. default-sha256: 73a3b579310de3247a81e45a4a83340bc53710d512f0aa90f25ca8540aeee657
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30E84B6F_8F74_4AF0_ADDC_808EFDF1312A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they are not equals in this endeavor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那三个男人，⟪k:3⟫地位并不对等。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d09d2826eaa9e23bf498f59c2f1b9545d507f16e0428988418f2cdba8686a07b
#. default-sha256: 92976cff8b759eb02a9434a1589846e297aefc5228a8679c75089789e732935d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D3D0545C_F221_4B95_A873_6E3CC38AAC56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If he wants out, then maybe he would have agreed to help if we told him we’re here "
"to save Morgana."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫如果是这样，⟪k:3⟫如果我们直接告诉他，⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫我们是为了救莫尔加娜才来到这里的，"
"⟪k:6⟫他应该就会帮我们了吧……？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0af3ef77718e6b96ee60528e05837eef3fed0ad79033166b0c4120aaccc92e8c
#. default-sha256: 2e7eea5d6e3aa695ef5179705cb7ea69918fe6d19a44f7f087076117a72d65f0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C4A1AD42_C0DB_446B_B367_D77A80C201D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’re right, we do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We know things we should have no way of knowing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫确实……⟪k:3⟫是这样呢。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫我们有着不为人知的记忆。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa968c1cff4eaaf56712840bf73f2b52ab71bd06fcbee1e7a73c78c6f029905d
#. default-sha256: 64fc40fdf059622cde4493cd8fe2082ba8f943ddfba07ef3020308fcbbd7491a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B78071E1_87A8_4D24_9C03_D878EF206223"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They each have their reasons for locking Morgana up,⟪k:3⟫and if I’m right, they’re "
"doing it for other people.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s these powerful bonds driving them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫比如说——有缘之人。⟪k:3⟫你觉得是为了谁，⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫才让他们做出囚禁莫尔加娜的事情呢？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5ab8f31e0b078407ce4a673473d129a8624b71ff8804e938937a2dd0ed1b575
#. default-sha256: 424146e2d56797e151e426f65b09398bc4bce7213798bcf493ff0706a6dde154
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C5D43FE0_8A03_4925_BF06_D65CB8E13139"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Are they mere bonds, or is it fate that ties them together?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（……这该说是牵绊，⟪k:2⟫还是因果呢……）"

#: scenario8:scenario8_95D11894_E9D5_4C48_887C_518C2C448366
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69022268e80daf95eb17ca5a2dbe4d24a4cd9e41638704de76e8f890ed2942c4
